- The `app` directory uses nested folders to define routes and a special `page.js` file to make a route segment publicly accessible.
- | `pages` Directory | `app` Directory       | Route          |
  | ----------------- | --------------------- | -------------- |
  | `index.js`        | `page.js`             | `/`            |
  | `about.js`        | `about/page.js`       | `/about`       |
